w.jpg","categoryId":71,"groupId":24414,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/707006/lorcana-tcg-whispers-in-the-well-whispers-in-the-well-case-file-cards-2-of-18","modifiedOn":"2026-07-21T19:15:46.17","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"Rarity","displayName":"Rarity","value":"None"},{"name":"Description","displayName":"Description","value":"ROO: \"I'm tired of all these questions, Mama. I wanna go home.\"\r\n<br>KANGA: \"Don't worry, dear. We'll be back to our lorebook in no time.\"\r\n<br>ROO: \"How do you know, Mama?\"\r\n<br>KANGA: \"Because we have Detective Wilde and everyone helping us. We just have to be brave.\"\r\n<br><em>Transcript of an interview with Kanga and Roo whispers</em>"}]},{"productId":707007,"name":"Whispers in the Well Case File Cards (3 of 18)","cleanName":"Whispers in the Well Case File Cards 3 of 18","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/707007_200w.jpg","categoryId":71,"groupId":24414,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/707007/lorcana-tcg-whispers-in-the-well-whispers-in-the-well-case-file-cards-3-of-18","modifiedOn":"2026-07-21T19:19:10.807","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"Rarity","displayName":"Rarity","value":"None"},{"name":"Description","displayName":"Description","value":"\"Say, friend, could you help a Genie out? I seem to have become separated from my iiitty-bitty lorebook. Bottles, lamps, books—you'd think a being of phenomenal cosmic powers would get tired of such small spaces after centuries. But I did like that lorebook.\"\r\n<br><em>Transcript of an interview with a Genie whisper</em>"}]},{"productId":707008,"name":"Whispers in the Well Case File Cards (4 of 18)","cleanName":"Whispers in the Well Case File Cards 4 of 18","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/707008_200w.jpg","categoryId":71,"groupId":24414,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/707008/lorcana-tcg-whispers-in-the-well-whispers-in-the-well-case-file-cards-4-of-18","modifiedOn":"2026-07-21T19:22:45.11","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"Rarity","displayName":"Rarity","value":"None"},{"name":"Description","displayName":"Description","value":"DET. GOOFY: \"Gawrsh, is this thing on?\"\r\n<br>DET. WILDE: \"Yes, Detective. Now, your report. Please.\"\r\n<br>GOOFY: \"Well, there I was, minding my business, when my sandwich turned into a smiling pink cat!\"\r\n<br>WILDE: \"A... pink cat?\"\r\n<br>GOOFY: \"Ayup. Oh golly, it's that one, right there on your shoulder!\"\r\n<br><em>Transcript of an interview with glimmer Detective Goofy</em>"}]},{"productId":707009,"name":"Whispers in the Well Case File Cards (5 of 18)","cleanName":"Whispers in the Well Case File Cards 5 of 18","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/707009_200w.jpg","categoryId":71,"groupId":24414,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/707009/lorcana-tcg-whispers-in-the-well-whispers-in-the-well-case-file-cards-5-of-18","modifiedOn":"2026-07-21T19:26:59.417","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"Rarity","displayName":"Rarity","value":"None"},{"name":"Description","displayName":"Description","value":"DET. HOPPS: \"So... Manny? Is that right?\"\r\n<br>MANHORSE: <em>(clop, clop, clop, clop)</em>\r\n<br>HOPPS: \"I see. I'm told you experienced a shock down in the Inkwell Caverns. Could you relate your story?\"\r\n<br>MANHORSE: <em>(clop, clop, clop-clop, clop)</em>\r\n<br>HOPPS: \"All right. Hey, Gearloose, do we have a headshot on file?\"\r\n<br><em>Transcript of an interview with a Headless Manhorse glimmer</em>"}]},{"productId":707010,"name":"Whispers in the Well Case File Cards (6 of 18)","cleanName":"Whispers in the Well Case File Cards 6 of 18","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/707010_200w.jpg","categoryId":71,"groupId":24414,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/707010/lorcana-tcg-whispers-in-the-well-whispers-in-the-well-case-file-cards-6-of-18","modifiedOn":"2026-07-21T19:30:27.793","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"Rarity","displayName":"Rarity","value":"None"},{"name":"Description","displayName":"Description","value":"\"Be careful. I walked down one of these staircases once and came right back up on account of all the strange noises. It doesn't look like anyone's been down here in ages—and there's no telling what might be lurking below the main floors...\"\r\n<br><em>Transcript of an interview with Illumineer Venturo</em>"}]},{"productId":707011,"name":"Whispers in the Well Case File Cards (7 of 18)","cleanName":"Whispers in the Well Case File Cards 7 of 18","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/707011_200w.jpg","categoryId":71,"groupId":24414,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/707011/lorcana-tcg-whispers-in-the-well-whispers-in-the-well-case-file-cards-7-of-18","modifiedOn":"2026-07-21T19:35:26.58","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"Rarity","displayName":"Rarity","value":"None"},{"name":"Description","displayName":"Description","value":"DET. HOPPS: \"I imagine you're used to strange things, as a wizard. Perhaps you could explain your current... situation, being so see-through and surrounded by these colorful wisps?\"\r\n<br>MERLIN: \"Well, it appears I am composed of incomplete materials. There's not enough substance for essence, and not enough essence for substance—you understand. Fiendish inconvenience, really.\"\r\n<br><em>Transcript of an interview with a Merlin whisper</em>"}]},{"productId":707012,"name":"Whispers in the Well Case File Cards (8 of 18)","cleanName":"Whispers in the Well Case File Cards 8 of 18","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/707012_200w.jpg","categoryId":71,"groupId":24414,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/707012/lorcana-tcg-whispers-in-the-well-whispers-in-the-well-case-file-cards-8-of-18","modifiedOn":"2026-07-21T19:38:24.963","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"Rarity","displayName":"Rarity","value":"None"},{"name":"Description","displayName":"Description","value":"\"We recovered a key hidden inside a book in the lost study. Further investigation revealed it opens a secret passageway leading deep into the Illuminary, beneath the Inkworks. I thought about following the passageway to see where it goes, but I could use backup on this one. I'll get Nick first.\"\r\n<br><em>Case files of glimmer Detective Judy Hopps</em>"}]},{"productId":707013,"name":"Whispers in the Well Case File Cards (9 of 18)","cleanName":"Whispers in the Well Case File Cards 9 of 18","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/707013_200w.jpg","categoryId":71,"groupId":24414,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/707013/lorcana-tcg-whispers-in-the-well-whispers-in-the-well-case-file-cards-9-of-18","modifiedOn":"2026-07-21T19:40:57.353","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"Rarity","displayName":"Rarity","value":"None"},{"name":"Description","displayName":"Description","value":"\"Second day of comparing the damaged lorebook pages we've recovered to the whispers who have come to us for help. Even with the entire Illuminary pitching in, it's slow going—but we won't give up!\"\r\n<br><em>Case files of glimmer Detective Judy Hopps</em>"}]},{"productId":707014,"name":"Whispers in the Well Case File Cards (10 of 18)","cleanName":"Whispers in the Well Case File Cards 10 of 18","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/707014_200w.jpg","categoryId":71,"groupId":24414,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/707014/lorcana-tcg-whispers-in-the-well-whispers-in-the-well-case-file-cards-10-of-18","modifiedOn":"2026-07-21T19:48:50.707","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"Rarity","displayName":"Rarity","value":"None"},{"name":"Description","displayName":"Description","value":"\"Cross-checking is done—for the whispers that want our help, anyway. Now we're facing the heart of the mystery: Who tore all those lorebook pages? And more importantly, how do we restore these whispers back to their original glimmer form?\"\r\n<br><em>Case files of glimmer Detective Judy Hopps</em>"}]},{"productId":707015,"name":"Whispers in the Well Case File Cards (11 of 18)","cleanName":"Whispers in the Well Case File Cards 11 of 18","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/707015_200w.jpg","categoryId":71,"groupId":24414,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/707015/lorcana-tcg-whispers-in-the-well-whispers-in-the-well-case-file-cards-11-of-18","modifiedOn":"2026-07-21T19:52:02.207","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"Rarity","displayName":"Rarity","value":"None"},{"name":"Description","displayName":"Description","value":"\"We discovered an ancient journal that seems to contain records of the glimmers on the torn pages. Nobody in the Illuminary knows who the book might have belonged to. Nick thinks the author lost their mind before completing it. In any case, the records are too damaged to tell us much.\"\r\n<br><em>Case files of glimmer Detective Judy Hopps</em>"}]},{"productId":707016,"name":"Whispers in the Well Case File Cards (12 of 18)","cleanName":"Whispers in the Well Case File Cards 12 of 18","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/707016_200w.jpg","categoryId":71,"groupId":24414,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/707016/lorcana-tcg-whispers-in-the-well-whispers-in-the-well-case-file-cards-12-of-18","modifiedOn":"2026-07-21T19:53:54.553","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"Rarity","displayName":"Rarity","value":"None"},{"name":"Description","displayName":"Description","value":"\"Ran into a Fairy Godmother whisper who seemed much less <em>bibbidi-bobbidi</em> and a lot more <em>boo</em>. She told me, 'I'd fix this up with a bit of magic, but I seem to be missing some of my abilities...I'm afraid I can't be of much help at all.'\"\r\n<br><em>Case files of glimmer Detective Judy Hopps</em>"}]},{"productId":707017,"name":"Whispers in the Well Case File Cards (13 of 18)","cleanName":"Whispers in the Well Case File Cards 13 of 18","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/707017_200w.jpg","categoryId":71,"groupId":24414,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/707017/lorcana-tcg-whispers-in-the-well-whispers-in-the-well-case-file-cards-13-of-18","modifiedOn":"2026-07-21T19:56:04.81","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"Rarity","displayName":"Rarity","value":"None"},{"name":"Description","displayName":"Description","value":"\"Something <em>weird</em> is going on here. I don't know how to describe what I saw! It was a glimmer of a woman, but so colorful and not...right. She was trying to pick up a scrap of paper, but couldn't—like she wasn't all there. If that makes any sense.\"\r\n<br><em>Witness statement from a Daisy Duck glimmer</em>"}]},{"productId":707018,"name":"Whispers in the Well Case File Cards (14 of 18)","cleanName":"Whispers in the Well Case File Cards 14 of 18","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/707018_200w.jpg","categoryId":71,"groupId":24414,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/707018/lorcana-tcg-whispers-in-the-well-whispers-in-the-well-case-file-cards-14-of-18","modifiedOn":"2026-07-21T19:59:07.98","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"Rarity","displayName":"Rarity","value":"None"},{"name":"Description","displayName":"Description","value":"\"Staked out the park for unusual litter-related activity yesterday, observing from a well-concealed position. Saw a ladybug. Really starting to like this whole detective thing. Oh, and nothing unusual to report. Maybe I blended in too well. Command, please advise on any disguise improvements.\"\r\n<br><em>Investigative report filed by glimmer Officer Higgins, detective trainee</em>"}]},{"productId":707019,"name":"Whispers in the Well Case File Cards (15 of 18)","cleanName":"Whispers in the Well Case File Cards 15 of 18","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/707019_200w.jpg","categoryId":71,"groupId":24414,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/707019/lorcana-tcg-whispers-in-the-well-whispers-in-the-well-case-file-cards-15-of-18","modifiedOn":"2026-07-21T20:00:58.063","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"Rarity","displayName":"Rarity","value":"None"},{"name":"Description","displayName":"Description","value":"\"Lab is clear of evidence connecting Xanatos to the whispers. Recovered plenty of weapons and gear that looks like it could be used to explore the caverns. I recommend we continue keeping tabs. If there's one thing I know about Xanatos, it's that he's up to no good—even if we can't prove it yet.\"\r\n<br><em>Investigative report filed by glimmer Detective Elisa Maza</em>"}]},{"productId":707020,"name":"Whispers in the Well Case File Cards (16 of 18)","cleanName":"Whispers in the Well Case File Cards 16 of 18","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/707020_200w.jpg","categoryId":71,"groupId":24414,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/707020/lorcana-tcg-whispers-in-the-well-whispers-in-the-well-case-file-cards-16-of-18","modifiedOn":"2026-07-21T20:02:51.157","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"Rarity","displayName":"Rarity","value":"None"},{"name":"Description","displayName":"Description","value":"\"Something is amiss on the lower floors of the Great Illuminary. Strange apparitions are about–whether conjured or inkcast, I cannot say. What I do know is that I intend to get to the bottom of this. Inform me at once if you discover anything of use in that ancient study.\"\r\n<br><em>Personal correspondence from glimmer Detective Basil to glimmer Dr. Dawson, special consultant</em>"}]},{"productId":707021,"name":"Whispers in the Well Case File Cards (17 of 18)","cleanName":"Whispers in the Well Case File Cards 17 of 18","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/707021_200w.jpg","categoryId":71,"groupId":24414,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/707021/lorcana-tcg-whispers-in-the-well-whispers-in-the-well-case-file-cards-17-of-18","modifiedOn":"2026-07-21T20:04:39.323","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"Rarity","displayName":"Rarity","value":"None"},{"name":"Description","displayName":"Description","value":"Agenda\r\n<br>1. Discuss the torn lorebook pages with Officer Hopps (Who likes to destroy lorebooks?)\r\n<br>2. Bring a dozen donuts for the office. (Sprinkles or glazed?)\r\n<br><em>Personal calendar of glimmer Officer Clawhauser, ZPD</em>"}]},{"productId":707022,"name":"Whispers in the Well Case File Cards (18 of 18)","cleanName":"Whispers in the Well Case File Cards 18 of 18","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/707022_200w.jpg","categoryId":71,"groupId":24414,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/707022/lorcana-tcg-whispers-in-the-well-whispers-in-the-well-case-file-cards-18-of-18","modifiedOn":"2026-07-21T20:07:14.387","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"Rarity","displayName":"Rarity","value":"None"},{"name":"Description","displayName":"Description","value":"DET. WILDE: \"Flash, buddy—we need your best effort on this one.\"\r\n<br>FLASH: \"I'm... working... on... it.\"\r\n<br>WILDE: \"Yeah, well, these whispers can't get back to their lorebooks, and we're their only chance of fixing that! Look, Judy needs this done soon.\"\r\n<br>FLASH: \"I... will... get it... to... Judy... ASAP.\"\r\n<br><em>Transcript of a ZPD investigative strategy meeting</em>"}]}]}